# Submission template only — not a Hermes catalog entry.
# Replace the placeholder only after this subdirectory is in a published GBrain commit.
# Hermes maintainer review and merge are still required before calling it listed.
name: gbrain
repo: https://github.com/garrytan/gbrain
sha: <published-40-character-commit-sha>
subdir: integrations/hermes
version: "1.0.0"
description: >-
  Native memory over HTTP MCP; capture is opt-in and server-gated.
  Disclosure — retrieval queries, standing entities, session identifiers and
  explicit tool arguments go to the configured GBrain endpoint. Before-turn
  queries are sent even with capture off; opted-in capture also sends paired
  user/assistant text. The bearer token comes from the profile secret scope.
maintainer: garrytan
tier: community
category: memory
capabilities:
  provides_tools: []
  provides_hooks: []
  provides_middleware: []
  requires_env:
    - GBRAIN_MCP_TOKEN
